Z||000000||Boodoggin||04-11-2000||09:35 PM||||Hey guys! I'm going to college this fall and eventually would like to have a career in law enforcement. Im not sure which particular carrer though.  Im thinking about private investigator a lot, it sounds like a cool job.  Any one here got a law enforcement job? ||||reg||10
